{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02511","headline":"巫山高 · 陆敬","name":"巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫岫郁迢嶤，高高入紫霄。\n白云抱危石，玄猨挂迥条。\n悬崖激巨浪，脆叶陨惊飙。\n别有阳台处，风雨共飘颻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆敬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}